{"id":"10-d0906b4615","name":"馬瀬ヶ谷戸","reading":"バセガイト","reading_estimated":false,"variants":[],"status":"historical","renamed_to":null,"admin":{"pref_code":"10","pref":"群馬県","municipality_code":null,"municipality":"桐生市","oaza":"川内町五丁目","koaza":"馬瀬ヶ谷戸","historical_village":"上仁田山村"},"location":{"lat":36.467193,"lon":139.339505,"precision":"oaza","geocode_source":"geolonia"},"area_key":"10203037005","hazard_types":[],"elements":[{"element_id":"yato","surface":"谷戸","reading":"ヤト","meaning":"谷口・低湿地。桐生市域では谷口の地名が集落名に転じた例が多い。豊川市の貝津（カイツ）は垣内由来とされるが小河川沿いに分布する傾向がある。"}],"etymology_summary":"馬瀬は間狭の替字。谷戸は集落地名。二つの尾根に挟まれた狭いくぼに出来た集落。谷戸は谷口をいう地名であったが、地形上人が住み良い所なので、最初に集落が出来た為集落名に変化した。後世は更に拡大して平地の集落名にもなった。ケ谷戸が本字。ガヤトがガイトに変化した。(馬瀬)間狭は狭間の反対","evidence":[{"kind":"local_history","stance":"supports","source_id":"kiryu_timeikou_2000","locator":null,"quote":"二つの尾根に挟まれた狭いくぼに出来た集落。","claim":"『桐生市地名考』が馬瀬ヶ谷戸を地形由来と説明する（くぼ）","level":1,"extracted_by":"human","quote_verified":true}],"evidence_level":1,"disputed":false,"dispute_note":null,"hazard_corroboration":{"debris_flow_zone":false,"steep_slope_zone":false,"landslide_zone":false,"flood_zone":false,"tsunami_zone":false,"storm_surge_zone":false,"avalanche_risk":false,"nearest_monument_ids":[],"related_disasters":[],"sampled_at":"2026-09-11T01:46:59+00:00"},"review":{"status":"auto","reviewer":null,"note":null},"dataset":"kiryu_timeikou","evidenceLevelLabel":"地形由来の記載あり","hazardLabels":[]}
